{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 10.920000076293945, "end_seconds": 15.680000305175781, "text": "In this case, the furthest person you can connect to is just 50 people away.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 15.680000305175781, "end_seconds": 19.15999984741211, "text": "So if you wanted to connect to someone on the other side of the planet through a chain", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
