{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 25.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 28.84000015258789, "text": "would take on average 40 million steps.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 28.84000015258789, "end_seconds": 34.20000076293945, "text": "Even just getting 10% to the way there would take 8 million steps, and 6 steps would get", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 34.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 37.540000915527344, "text": "you, well, here.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 37.540000915527344, "end_seconds": 40.68000030517578, "text": "This is the paradox of 6 degrees of separation.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 40.68000030517578, "end_seconds": 45.400001525878906, "text": "We know that we live in these local clusters of friends and acquaintances, but we also", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
