{"video_id": "fkxoaD47-Vo", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 49.68000030517578, "end_seconds": 53.84000015258789, "text": "Ten years ago, I did my own experiment on this, and I found that the average Veritasium", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
